    metaDescription: "Why do brands choose a sportswear manufacturer in Sialkot, Pakistan? 10 honest reasons, from low MOQs and fast sampling to export infrastructure, plus when Sialkot may not be the right fit.",
    excerpt: "Why do brands choose a sportswear manufacturer in Sialkot, Pakistan? 10 honest reasons, from low MOQs and fast sampling to export infrastructure, plus when Sialkot may not be the right fit.",
    category: 'All Articles',
